cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Moment Distribution Method (Hardy Cross): MATLAB and Python Implementation"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB and Python implementation of the moment distribution method
  (Hardy Cross) for the structural analysis of statically indeterminate
  beams and frames. In every step the node with the largest unbalanced moment
  is released and its moment is distributed by the distribution factors and
  carried over by the carryover factors (Cross and Csonka-Werner procedures).
  Both implementations produce the same formatted report with all iteration
  steps. Used in the Structural Analysis 2 course at the Faculty of Civil
  Engineering and Architecture Osijek, Josip Juraj Strossmayer University of Osijek.
